{"bookId":"cp-2","editionId":"6879da4e6ec271ab","chapterId":"c0195","paragraphs":[{"id":"pb1749a022aa5-1","text":"卷尽愁云，素娥临夜新梳洗。"},{"id":"p7986a5965f70-1","text":"暗尘不起。"},{"id":"p860e39bdc52a-1","text":"酥润凌波地。"},{"id":"p02b4070992b7-1","text":"辇路重来，仿佛灯前事。"},{"id":"p9fea66e19417-1","text":"情如水。"},{"id":"pee2485ddc00f-1","text":"小楼熏被。"},{"id":"pfdcb72073971-1","text":"春梦笙歌里。"}]}